  "summary": "My goal is making much of God by following Jesus Christ as my Lord and Savior. \n\nMy job-technology-focus is SQL Database and Web Developer, Senior Analyst working on .NET Microsoft Technology strategy and training in a Creative Department.\n\nMy volunteer involvements include a Used Book Ministry for Inmates, Detention Facility Bible study, and occasionally helping out Books to Benefit. I'm a heavy user of coffee (incredibly enough for taste). \n\nMy theme in life is to love the Lord my God with all my heart, mind, soul, and strength and to love people. To rejoice in and emphasize our creator God's deep desire for a love-relationship that resulted in Him sending his one and only begotten son Jesus Christ into this world not to condemn the world but to save it through Jesus' torture, death, and resurrection back to life. This sacrifice pays the penalty I and the whole world owes for our sins -- for our rebellion against God. The perfect sacrifice of Jesus Christ makes available to all God's Forgiveness and Grace in return for our lives. This for all who believe in Jesus Christ and follow Him as Lord and Savior, through restored relationship with God through His Son. . \n\nSpecialties: Teaching, preaching, and many technical involvements. Specializing in planning and promoting change, SQL Database Design and T-SQL programming with familiarity and experience involving HTML, JavaScript, CSS, Regular Expressions, C#, VB, Razor, MVC, EF, ASP.NET, PowerShell, and many older technologies.",
