    "description": "http://usedbookministry.com\n\nThe Used Book Ministry for Inmates of Salem Church founded by the late Christine Folkers continues with the following Mission, Vision, Beliefs, and Goals.\n\nOur Mission is to partner in placing resources and mentoring in individual’s lives leading them into a decision for Christ and discipleship. See Luke 4:18, Hebrews 13:3, and Isaiah 61:1.\n\nOur Vision is to share God’s truth and love with those imprisoned and in need.\nWe Believe the Bible is the Word of God containing timeless truth useful for teaching, for reproof, for correction, and for training in righteousness (2 Timothy 3:16-17). Every part of our ministry falls under the authority of the Bible. The Word is the foundation for both our understanding of God and our beliefs.\n\nWe believe in God, the Father Almighty, Creator of Heaven and earth; and in Jesus Christ, His only Son Our Lord, who was conceived by the Holy Spirit, born of the Virgin Mary, suffered under Pontius Pilate, was crucified, died, and was buried. He descended into Hell; the third day He rose again from the dead; He ascended into Heaven, and is seated at the right hand of God, the Father almighty. From there He will come to judge the living and the dead. We believe in the Holy Spirit, the holy Church, the communion of saints, the forgiveness of sins, the resurrection of the body and life everlasting. Amen.",
